{
  "id": "E384",
  "title": "Easily Amused",
  "level": "newbie",
  "date": "2019-12-05",
  "synopsis": "Paul and Little Le watched a movie together, but they had different opinions about the movie.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/50384/9b6f88ef7261346139f6a25f0c10393a3199706b.mp3?1575283996",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "笑点太低了\n\n保罗：这电影太好玩了，笑死我了！\n小乐：还好吧，我没有觉得很好笑啊。\n保罗：真的假的？我从头笑到尾！\n小乐：是你的笑点太低了吧。\n保罗：才不是，我觉得是你的笑点太高了。\n",
    "traditional": "笑點太低了\n\n保羅：這電影太好玩了，笑死我了！\n小樂：還好吧，我沒有覺得很好笑啊。\n保羅：真的假的？我從頭笑到尾！\n小樂：是你的笑點太低了吧。\n保羅：才不是，我覺得是你的笑點太高了。\n"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "You’re too easily amused"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "保罗：这电影太好玩了，笑死我了！",
      "traditional": "保羅：這電影太好玩了，笑死我了！",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó zhè diàn yǐng tài hǎo wán le xiào sǐ wǒ le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Paul: The movie was so funny, it made me laugh to death!"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "小乐：还好吧，我没有觉得很好笑啊。",
      "traditional": "小樂：還好吧，我沒有覺得很好笑啊。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lè hái hǎo ba wǒ méi yǒu jué de hěn hǎo xiào a",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Le: It was alright, I don’t think it was that funny."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "保罗：真的假的？我从头笑到尾！",
      "traditional": "保羅：真的假的？我從頭笑到尾！",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó zhēn de jiǎ de wǒ cóng tóu xiào dào wěi",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Paul: Really? I was laughing from beginning to end!"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "小乐：是你的笑点太低了吧。",
      "traditional": "小樂：是你的笑點太低了吧。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lè shì nǐ de xiào diǎn tài dī le ba",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Le: It’s you that’s too easily amused."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "保罗：才不是，我觉得是你的笑点太高了。",
      "traditional": "保羅：才不是，我覺得是你的笑點太高了。",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó cái bú shì wǒ jué de shì nǐ de xiào diǎn tài gāo le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Paul: Certainly not, I think that it’s you who is too hard to amuse."
    }
  ],
